tes. The candidates have titles with patterns like:\n- Topic: 事务传播, 缓存失效, 任务取消, 线程池排队, 连接池等待, 接口幂等, 并发更新, 慢查询, 组合索引, 消息重复\n- Context: 内容管理接口, 社区服务, 消息消费者, 后台处理任务\n- Content type: 概念速览 (concept overview), 操作记录 (operation record), 条件与原理 (conditions & principles), 专题观察 (special topic observation), 市场观察 (market observation)\n\nThe user explicitly does NOT want content about 培训招生 (training enrollment), 证书宣传 (certificate promotion), or 求职薪资榜单 (salary ranking lists). The \"市场观察\" (market observation) type content explicitly covers \"培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名\" which is exactly what the user doesn't want.\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates.\n\nThe user wants content about databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. The relevant content types are:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 操作记录 (operation record)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - this is about tech community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration and industry culture. This is less directly about implementation/principles but not explicitly excluded.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are NOT 市场观察 (market observation). Let me filter out all market observation ones.\n\nLet me count the candidates and identify which are market observation (to exclude).\n\nMarket observation candidates (contain \"市场观察\" in title):\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27 线程池排队：社区服务中的市场观察\n- item-0af1c4827cd8 连接池等待：后台处理任务中的市场观察\n- item-0be6197962c6 接口幂等：内容管理接口中的市场观察\n- item-10482516c15c 缓存失效：消息消费者中的市场观察\n- item-1178ddd58b15 并发更新：社区服务中的市场观察\n- item-1a7442187146 线程池排队：后台处理任务中的市场观察\n- item-1c3f785dd079 任务取消：内容管理接口中的市场观察\n- item-3356f301eff1 事务传播：消息消费者中的市场观察\n- item-34481c910531 连接池等待：内容管理接口中的市场观察\n- item-3b9f2dc9469c 事务传播：内容管理接口中的市场观察\n- item-3cca11fe4770 并发更新：内容管理接口中的市场观察\n- item-3dd8795cff7b 组合索引：消息消费者中的市场观察\n- item-4780c84a7983 消息重复：消息消费者中的市场观察\n- item-50c1d851bc3e 连接池等待：社区服务中的市场观察\n- item-5844dd71f1b0 任务取消：消息消费者中的市场观察\n- item-5fcb0644cc52 接口幂等：社区服