principles of databases, concurrency, and service fault handling. The most relevant content types are 条件与原理, 操作记录, and 概念速览. The 专题观察 content is about tech community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration and industry culture - which is less aligned with the technical implementation focus.\n\nI need to select 20 candidates. Given the user's focus, I'll prioritize 条件与原理, 操作记录, and 概念速览 types, which are the most technically relevant. I'll aim for a balanced selection across topics and contexts.\n\nLet me select 20 from the 47 candidates (15+16+16) that are the technical content types.\n\nLet me aim for balance across the topics. Topics:\n- 事务传播 (transaction propagation): 条件与原理 (167782, 3b6e33, 493d69), 操作记录 (45f8ac), 概念速览 (356556)\n- 缓存失效 (cache invalidation): 操作记录 (042e55, 5987d2), 概念速览 (17427e, 3c858e, 43d0c4)\n- 任务取消 (task cancellation): 条件与原理 (07ad7c, 501f16), 操作记录 (382293, 52cdcf, 5b1d60), 概念速览 (432150)\n- 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing): 概念速览 (07b1bd, 0b384e), 条件与原理 (5ccc33)\n- 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting): 操作记录 (098771, 1ba5c7), 条件与原理 (20bfb5, 484f44), 概念速览 (506e45, 63e2cd)\n- 接口幂等 (interface idempotency): 条件与原理 (311566, 349403, 48bbae), 操作记录 (0cf0da, 326a31, 379d26), 概念速览 (411d8c, 623f03)\n- 并发更新 (concurrent update): 条件与原理 (17c3bb, 597155), 操作记录 (516014), 概念速览 (1682f4, 4ade04)\n- 慢查询 (slow query): 操作记录 (37ef33, 5462ff), 概念速览 (140efa, 32e7f1)\n- 组合索引 (composite index): 条件与原理 (499e65), 操作记录 (3b4891), 概念速览 (37b1c2)\n- 消息重复 (message duplication): 条件与原理 (3a036e), 操作记录 (1d6434)\n\nI'll select 20 candidates that are technically relevant, balanced across topics and content types. Let me pick a good mix.\n\nGiven the user's focus on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling, I'll select a balanced set. Let me choose 20 from the technical content types (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me select a diverse set covering all topics and contexts:\n\n1. item-167782abe824 事务传播：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n2. item-45f8ac57ea42 事务传播：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n3. item-04